## Phase 1: Environment Setup

### 1.1 Software Installation

| Software | Version | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| **Vivado** | 2022.1 or 2023.1 | FPGA synthesis, block design |
| **Vitis HLS** | 2022.1 or 2023.1 | C++ → RTL compilation |
| **Vitis** (SDK) | 2022.1 or 2023.1 | ARM bare-metal/Linux app |
| **PetaLinux** | 2022.1 (optional) | Linux on ARM |

All come in one installer (~100GB). Free WebPACK license covers Zynq-7020.

### 1.2 ZedBoard SD Boot Configuration

| Jumper | Setting | Function |
|--------|---------|----------|
| JP7 | GND | Cascaded JTAG |
| JP8 | HIGH | Boot Mode[0] = 1 |
| JP9 | HIGH | Boot Mode[1] = 1 |
| JP10 | LOW | Boot Mode[2] = 0 |
| JP11 | GND | Use PLL |

