## Phase 3: Vivado Block Design

Integrate HLS IP with Zynq PS in Vivado:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Vivado["Vivado Block Design"]
        ZYNQ["Zynq PS\n(ARM Cortex-A9)"]
        AXI_IC["AXI Interconnect"]
        DMA["AXI DMA"]
        CNN["CNN Accelerator\n(HLS IP)"]
        DDR["DDR3 Controller"]
        
        ZYNQ <-->|"AXI GP"| AXI_IC
        AXI_IC <--> DMA
        AXI_IC <--> CNN
        ZYNQ <-->|"AXI HP"| DDR
        DMA <-->|"AXI Stream"| CNN
    end
```

Steps:
1. Export HLS IP from Vitis HLS → IP Catalog
2. Create Vivado block design with Zynq PS
3. Add HLS IP + AXI DMA + AXI Interconnect
4. Run Connection Automation
5. Generate Bitstream

