## Phase 6: Performance Analysis

| Metric | CPU-Only | FPGA-Accelerated | Improvement |
|--------|----------|------------------|-------------|
| Latency per frame | ~200ms (est.) | ~30ms (target) | **~6× speedup** |
| Throughput (FPS) | ~5 FPS | ~30 FPS | **6×** |
| Power | ~2W | ~3W total | Better perf/watt |
| Resource Usage | N/A | LUTs, BRAM, DSP | Documented |

