## Verification Plan

### HLS Simulation (Before Hardware)

```bash
# In Vitis HLS — C simulation (verify correctness)
vitis_hls -f run_csim.tcl

# Co-simulation (verify RTL matches C)
vitis_hls -f run_cosim.tcl
```

### Hardware Testing

| Step | Test | Expected |
|------|------|----------|
| 1 | HLS C simulation | Output matches golden reference |
| 2 | HLS Co-simulation | RTL matches C output |
| 3 | Vivado synthesis | Design fits in XC7Z020 |
| 4 | Boot ZedBoard | Serial console shows output |
| 5 | DMA transfer test | Data moves PS ↔ PL correctly |
| 6 | CNN inference | Correct classification |
| 7 | Laptop camera stream | Real-time detection visible |

